@startuml
title Target Notaire Architecture — Modern Three-Tier
left to right direction

actor "Usuario final" as User

node "Frontend Web\n(Next.js 16 / React 19)" {
  [React UI + Design Tokens] as WebUI
  [TanStack Query + API Client] as WebClient
}

node "Frontend Swing (Deprecated)" #LightGray {
  [Swing UI] as SwingUI
  [REST Client] as SwingClient
}

node "Backend API\n(Spring Boot 4.1 / Java 21)" {
  [REST Controllers] as API
  [Spring Security + JWT] as Sec
  [Business Services] as Svc
  [Spring Data JPA Repositories] as Repo
  [Domain Entities (negocio)] as Domain
  [Audit Aspect] as Audit
}

database "PostgreSQL 16\n(Flyway-managed)" as Postgres
cloud "Shared Contracts\n(notaire-shared DTOs)" as Shared

node "Observability Stack" {
  [Prometheus] as Prom
  [Grafana] as Graf
  [Loki + Promtail] as Loki
}

node "DevSecOps" {
  [SonarQube] as Sonar
  [Homer Dashboard] as Homer
}

User --> WebUI : HTTPS
WebUI --> WebClient
WebClient --> API : HTTP/JSON (JWT)

User ..> SwingUI : Legacy access
SwingUI --> SwingClient
SwingClient --> API : HTTP/JSON (JWT)

API --> Sec : Authentication
Sec --> Svc : Authorized requests
Svc --> Repo : Persistence
Repo --> Postgres : SQL / Hibernate
Svc --> Audit : Auditable
Audit --> Postgres : INSERT audit trail

API ..> Shared : DTO contracts

Prom --> API : /actuator/prometheus
Loki --> API : Log collection
Graf --> Prom : Dashboards
Graf --> Loki : Log queries
@enduml
